# β-Reduction: Reduction (I4), Determinism (I5), GCP (I6)

Placeholder for the verification that β-reduction in λ-calculus satisfies the
TRA-level reduction predicate (R1 / I4), that closed β-reduction is
deterministic (B4 / I5), and that β satisfies GCP (O3 / I6). These instances
are needed to instantiate the Bridge Theorem on the λ-calculus.

## References

* Gavazzo, *An Algebraic Approach to Formal System Metatheory*, LICS 2026, Example 19 / §6.1.1
